"surface":"我","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"主本明見人物；來源局部身份，此次分配來源局部ID，未宣稱跨史身份已全部覆核。"}],"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye","book_id":"b-liangshu-030","work_id":"w-liangshu","source_id":"s-liang030-ws1508510"},{"text":"初，子野曾祖松之，宋元嘉中受詔續修何承天宋史，未成而卒，子野常欲繼成先業。及齊永明末，沈約所撰《宋書》稱「松之已後無聞焉」。子野更撰為《宋略》二十卷，其敘事評論多善，而云：「戮淮南太守沈璞，以其不從義師故也」。約懼，徒跣謝之，請兩釋焉。歎其述作曰：「吾弗逮也。」蘭陵蕭琛言其評論可與過秦、王命分路揚鑣。於是吏部尚書徐勉言之于武帝，以為著作郎，掌修國史及起居注。頃之，兼中書通事舍人，尋除通直員外，著作、舍人如故。敕又掌中書詔誥。","source_position":{"start":10542,"end":10760,"raw":"初，子野曾祖松之，宋元嘉中受詔續修何承天宋史，未成而卒，子野常欲繼成先業。及齊永明末，沈約所撰《[[宋書]]》稱「松之已後無聞焉」。子野更撰為《宋略》二十卷，其敘事評論多善，而云：「戮淮南太守沈璞，以其不從義師故也」。約懼，徒跣謝之，請兩釋焉。歎其述作曰：「吾弗逮也。」蘭陵蕭琛言其評論可與過秦、王命分路揚鑣。於是吏部尚書徐勉言之于武帝，以為著作郎，掌修國史及起居注。頃之，兼中書通事舍人，尋除通直員外，著作、舍人如故。敕又掌中書詔誥。","raw_path":"sources/nanshi/wikisource-1554233-raw.wikitext"},"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p018","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p018:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p018:m0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"松之","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"裴松之字世期、祖昧父珪、注陳壽三國志及子駰，與宋064同組識別特徵。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p018:m0017","start":17,"end":20,"surface":"何承天","kind":"person","person_id":"92h_l93_ixy","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"松之受命續何承天國史、未成而卒；宋064與梁030同一續宋史事，何承天為先修史者。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p018:m0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p018:m0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"沈約","kind":"person","person_id":"p8b_7w1_y3q","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"宋書稱松之以後無聞，子野宋略議沈璞後沈約謝之；梁030同著述、同對話。單約承沈約。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p018:m0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"松之","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"裴松之字世期、祖昧父珪、注陳壽三國志及子駰，與宋064同組識別特徵。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p018:m0062","start":62,"end":64,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p018:m0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"沈璞","kind":"person","person_id":"xjp_yek_myy","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"子野宋略所論被戮的淮南太守沈璞，暫以人名與官名識別，不從評論推死年或罪事真偽。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p018:m0096","start":96,"end":97,"surface":"其","kind":"person","person_id":"xjp_yek_myy","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"子野宋略所論被戮的淮南太守沈璞，暫以人名與官名識別，不從評論推死年或罪事真偽。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p018:m0105","start":105,"end":106,"surface":"約","kind":"person","person_id":"p8b_7w1_y3q","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"宋書稱松之以後無聞，子野宋略議沈璞後沈約謝之；梁030同著述、同對話。單約承沈約。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p018:m0111","start":111,"end":112,"surface":"之","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p018:m0125","start":125,"end":126,"surface":"吾","kind":"person","person_id":"p8b_7w1_y3q","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"宋書稱松之以後無聞，子野宋略議沈璞後沈約謝之；梁030同著述、同對話。單約承沈約。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p018:m0133","start":133,"end":135,"surface":"蕭琛","kind":"person","person_id":"m5h_0x9_uxb","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"蘭陵蕭琛稱子野評論與過秦王命比，梁030同地望同文評。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p018:m0157","start":157,"end":159,"surface":"徐勉","kind":"person","person_id":"r9i_hp1_yo6","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"吏部尚書薦子野掌國史，後與周舍劉之遴觀移魏文；梁030同薦舉和文事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p018:m0162","start":162,"end":164,"surface":"武帝","kind":"person","person_id":"fo7_f8v_rmf","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"梁天監起用、普通移魏文、中大通贈諡等子野朝事，梁030相同事稱高祖；不是齊永明武帝。"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family","book_id":"b-nanshi-033","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi033-ws1554233"},{"text":"繼母曹氏亡，居喪過禮，服闋，再遷員外郎。普通七年，大舉北侵，敕子野為移魏文，受詔立成。武帝以其事體大，召尚書僕射徐勉、太子詹事周舍、鴻臚卿劉之遴、中書侍郎朱異集壽光殿以觀之，時並嘆服。武帝目子野曰：「其形雖弱，其文甚壯。」俄又敕為書喻魏相元叉。其夜受旨，子野謂可待旦方奏，未之為也，及五鼓，敕催令速上。子野徐起操筆，昧爽便就。及奏，武帝深嘉焉。自是諸符檄皆令具草。","source_position":{"start":10956,"end":11145,"raw":"繼母曹氏亡，居喪過禮，服闋，再遷員外郎。{{YL|普通七年}}，大舉北侵，敕子野為移魏文，受詔立成。武帝以其事體大，召尚書僕射徐勉、太子詹事周舍、鴻臚卿劉之遴、中書侍郎朱異集壽光殿以觀之，時並嘆服。武帝目子野曰：「其形雖弱，其文甚壯。」俄又敕為書喻魏相元叉。其夜受旨，子野謂可待旦方奏，未之為也，及五鼓，敕催令速上。子野徐起操筆，昧爽便就。及奏，武帝深嘉焉。自是諸符檄皆令具草。","raw_path":"sources/nanshi/wikisource-1554233-raw.wikitext"},"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p020","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p020:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"曹氏","kind":"person","person_id":"l1o_9k9_jyk","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"子野敘事繼母曹氏亡、居喪過禮，暫登其繼母未名個人，不與其他曹氏、生母魏或祖母殷合併。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p020:m0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p020:m0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"武帝","kind":"person","person_id":"fo7_f8v_rmf","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"梁天監起用、普通移魏文、中大通贈諡等子野朝事，梁030相同事稱高祖；不是齊永明武帝。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p020:m0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"徐勉","kind":"person","person_id":"r9i_hp1_yo6","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"吏部尚書薦子野掌國史，後與周舍劉之遴觀移魏文；梁030同薦舉和文事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p020:m0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"周舍","kind":"person","person_id":"tyk_15n_8t3","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"梁普通觀移魏文的太子詹事周舍，梁030同一文事作太子詹事周捨；用tyk梁廷身份，拒漢文周舍3u2或趙簡子候選。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p020:m0069","start":69,"end":72,"surface":"劉之遴","kind":"person","person_id":"q7n_s7f_1cs","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"南陽劉之遴先在交遊列、後鴻臚卿觀移魏文，梁030同地望、同官、同文事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p020:m0077","start":77,"end":79,"surface":"朱異","kind":"person","person_id":"4nv_kdx_8z9","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"中書侍郎朱異與徐勉周舍劉之遴觀子野移魏文，梁030同官、同人列、同事件作朱异，保異字。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p020:m0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"武帝","kind":"person","person_id":"fo7_f8v_rmf","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"梁天監起用、普通移魏文、中大通贈諡等子野朝事，梁030相同事稱高祖；不是齊永明武帝。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p020:m0095","start":95,"end":97,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p020:m0100","start":100,"end":101,"surface":"其","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p020:m0105","start":105,"end":106,"surface":"其","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p020:m0119","start":119,"end":121,"surface":"元叉","kind":"person","person_id":"hd4_vcg_a69","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"受子野書諭之魏相元叉，梁030同移魏文後撰書事件作元乂，非同字猜配。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p020:m0127","start":127,"end":129,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p020:m0151","start":151,"end":153,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","status":"contex